      "text": "The attacker was able to manipulate the price of EAC on pancake swap, allowing them to trade from pair token to EAC for a profit Vulnerable Code Snippet: Attack Transaction: https://bscscan.com/tx/0x477f9ee698ac8ae800ffa012ab52fd8de39b58996245c5e39a4233c1ae5f1baa Analysis: https://lunaray.medium.com/eac-hack-analysis-8c66d4237f11"
