    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "EAC was exploited on BNB Chain on 29 August 2023, suffering a loss of approximately $6,376. The attacker manipulated the PancakeSwap spot price through a flash-loan sequence, enabling extraction of funds at a temporarily inflated valuation. No official victim code or detailed protocol disclosure is available; the event is reconstructed from secondary sources and on-chain pattern. EAC relied on the instantly updated PancakeSwap AMM spot price for valuation, allowing an attacker to manipulate the price within one block via flash-loan swaps. This enabled extraction of assets based on inflated collateral or settlement values. Technical details are inferred…"
